{"ref":"BDB, מַאֲרָב","hw":"מַאֲרָב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲרָב</span></big>  <strong>n.m. ambush</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲרָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:9\" href=\"/Joshua.8.9\">Jos 8:9</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאְ֯רָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:35\" href=\"/Judges.9.35\">Ju 9:35</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַאֲרַב</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:8\" href=\"/Psalms.10.8\">ψ 10:8</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>ambush</em>, place of lying-in-wait <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:9\" href=\"/Joshua.8.9\">Jos 8:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:35\" href=\"/Judges.9.35\">Ju 9:35</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  <em>lurking-place</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:8\" href=\"/Psalms.10.8\">ψ 10:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִסְתָּרִים</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>liers-in-wait</em> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.13\">2 Ch 13:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אָרַב\" href=\"/BDB,_אָרַב\", dir=\"rtl\">ארב</a> Pt.)","next":"BDB, אַרְבֵאל","prev":"BDB, אֲרֻבּוֹת"}